__pycache__/
*.pyc

# `.claude/rules/identicon.md` is deliberately NOT ignored. It holds every
# rendering variant rather than a chosen one, so every checkout derives the same
# file from the same settings and there is no preference in it to impose on
# anyone. Committing it is what makes it present in every worktree, since
# `git worktree add` materialises tracked files only.
